    {
      "@id": "https://knoedg.nyc/inside-the-map-of-30-immigrant-enclaves/#claim-artifact",
      "@type": "schema:Claim",
      "schema:text": "A map titled “NEW YORK CITY IMMIGRANT ENCLAVES”, footnoted “Source: NYC Mayor’s Office of Immigrant Affairs”, lists 30 numbered enclaves with transit access and does not include Little Italy. It was published by New York City Tourism + Conventions, established from its host page’s own source rather than from press attribution. The same bytes are attested by an archived capture taken 2026-06-17, three weeks before the criticism: identical checksum, identical length.",
